  "notes": "⟦{切|き}る→切る：02693_kiru⟧ (to cut) + ⟦{立|た}つ→立つ：00758_tatsu⟧ (to stand). Almost always appears as {切|き}り{立|た}った before a noun, or as {切|き}り{立|た}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧, describing a landscape; other forms are rare.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nIntransitive.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {切|き}り{立|た}った⟦{崖|がけ}→崖：05391_gake⟧: a sheer cliff\n- {切|き}り{立|た}った⟦{岩山|いわやま}→岩山：23863_iwayama⟧: a steep rocky mountain\n- {切|き}り{立|た}った⟦{断崖|だんがい}→断崖：05039_dangai⟧: a precipice",
